<!-- 1. DESIGN                                                                 -->
<!-- ========================================================================= -->
<h1>1. Design</h1>

<h2>1.1 Architectural Design</h2>
<p>
  The system architecture of <strong>Aura Money</strong> follows a <strong>Clean Component-Driven Single-Page Architecture (SPA)</strong> integrated with a <strong>Serverless Backend-as-a-Service (BaaS)</strong> layer powered by Google Cloud Firestore and Firebase Authentication. This pattern achieves clear separation of concerns between presentation, reactive state coordination, domain business logic, and cloud persistence.
</p>
<p>
  The client-side architecture is structured into four primary logical tiers:
</p>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Presentation Tier:</strong> React 18 view components (`DashboardView`, `IncomeView`, `ExpensesView`, `BudgetView`, `ReportsView`, `Navbar`, and entry modals) styled with atomic utility classes via Tailwind CSS.</li>
  <li><strong>State &amp; Controller Tier:</strong> Reactive custom hooks (`useFinanceData`, `useAuth`) that manage user sessions, coordinate Firestore real-time snapshot subscriptions, and emit state updates.</li>
  <li><strong>Domain &amp; Analytics Tier:</strong> Strict TypeScript computation pipelines that derive real-time budget variances, daily trajectories, 12-month annual cashflows, and cumulative savings without mutating core models.</li>
  <li><strong>Data Persistence &amp; Security Tier:</strong> Cloud Firestore distributed document store guarded by granular owner-bound security rules (`firestore.rules`) and federated identity token verification.</li>
</ol>

<div class="uml-box">
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                               AURA MONEY ARCHITECTURE                                 |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                           |
                                [Client Browser Runtime]
                                           |
  +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  |                                PRESENTATION TIER                                 |
  |  +---------------+  +---------------+  +---------------+  +-------------------+  |
  |  | DashboardView |  |  IncomeView   |  | ExpensesView  |  | ReportsView (12M) |  |
  |  +---------------+  +---------------+  +---------------+  +-------------------+  |
  |  |  BudgetView   |  | Navbar / Nav  |  | Entry Modals  |  | Visual Charts     |  |
  |  +---------------+  +---------------+  +---------------+  +-------------------+  |
  +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                           |
                                [Reactive Data Flow]
                                           v
  +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  |                          STATE &amp; DOMAIN LOGIC TIER                               |
  |  +------------------------------------+  +------------------------------------+  |
  |  |     Custom Hooks (useFinanceData)  |  |     Aggregation &amp; Trend Selectors  |  |
  |  |  - Firestore snapshot subscriptions|  |  - 12-Month cashflow matrix        |  |
  |  |  - Optimistic client updates       |  |  - Category budget variance engine |  |
  |  +------------------------------------+  +------------------------------------+  |
  |  +------------------------------------+  +------------------------------------+  |
  |  |      Authentication Context        |  |      CSV Sanitization Engine       |  |
  |  |  - Firebase Google SSO Listener    |  |  - RFC 4180 Formula Shield        |  |
  |  +------------------------------------+  +------------------------------------+  |
  +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                           |
                           [Secure Transport: HTTPS / WSS]
                                           v
  +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  |                         PERSISTENCE &amp; CLOUD SECURITY                             |
  |  +------------------------------------+  +------------------------------------+  |
  |  |        Firebase Authentication     |  |          Cloud Firestore           |  |
