<h2>1.5 Database Design</h2>
<p>
  Cloud Firestore employs a schemaless NoSQL hierarchical collection structure. To enforce strict data isolation and zero cross-user visibility, all financial entities are stored under user-scoped subcollections:
</p>

<h3>1.5.1 Schema Definitions</h3>
