<p>
  The <strong>Second Review Phase</strong> confirms the architectural integrity, robust database modeling, and technical rigor of <strong>Aura Money</strong>. By pairing a reactive TypeScript/React frontend with serverless Cloud Firestore security boundaries, the platform achieves both instantaneous financial analysis and enterprise data isolation.
</p>
<p>
  All system modules—from transaction ingestion and dynamic budget threshold warnings to 12-month visual cashflow analytics and RFC 4180-compliant CSV exports—are fully functional, passing 100% of defined verification test plans.
